---
description: Nested selectors, structrue written multiple times, 1 for unchaging styles, again for different states
globs: app/**/*.{tsx,scss}
alwaysApply: true
---

- selectors should be nested based the same way the elements are nested in the dom. Eg

```
comp-view {
  tournament-details {
    comp-details-header {
      comp-title {
      }
    }
    text-box-container {
      text-box {
        text-box-label {
        }
        text-box-value {
        }
      }
    }
  }
  comp-actions {
  }
  tournament-brackets{
  }
}
```

- when the layout changes from media queries or classes that represent the layout in a different state, the styles should be applied in a copy of the same structure but only for that state context. Eg

```
comp-view {

  .is-landscape & {
    tournament-details {
      comp-details-header {
        comp-title {
        }
      }
      text-box-container {
        text-box {
          text-box-label {
          }
          text-box-value {
          }
        }
      }
    }
    comp-actions {
    }
    tournament-brackets{
    }
  }

  .is-portrait & {
    tournament-details {
      comp-details-header {
        comp-title {
        }
      }
      text-box-container {
        text-box {
          text-box-label {
          }
          text-box-value {
          }
        }
      }
    }
    comp-actions {
    }
    tournament-brackets{
    }
  }
}

```
